      "translatable": true,
      "contextBefore": "Discussion",
      "contextAfter": "If the person makes a new attempt at the task — for example, by starting a game level over, and your app creates a new activity with a call to [`createNewActivity()`](clscontext/createnewactivity().md) — then the framework stops the old one permanently and makes it inaccessible to your app thereafter.",
